From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raghavt20 <raghavt20@aospa.co>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 17:45:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] daxService: recover lost DAP control before setting
 profile

DolbyProvider.update()'s dolby-profile branch calls checkDolbyInstance(),
which only verifies mDolbyAudio.isInitialized() before handing off to
DolbyAudioEffectHelper.setDolbyProfile(). setDolbyProfile() in turn calls
waitForDolbyControl(), which polls mDolbyAudio.hasControl() for up to
~1s and silently gives up (never calling AudioEffect.setProfile()) if
control was never granted - which is consistently the case here, since
mDolbyAudio's own handle loses the control race to another effect
client (confirmed via dumpsys media.audio_flinger: two DAP clients from
the same PID, only one holding control) and nothing ever detects or
recovers from that.

The load_user_settings branch in this same class already has the
correct handling for this: checkDolbyInstanceControl() additionally
checks mDolbyAudio.hasControl() and, if false, calls
restartDolbyInstance() (which releases the stale handle and creates a
fresh one) before proceeding. The dolby-profile branch was just never
updated to use it, so every profile switch away from the currently
active profile times out and the UI reverts to the previous selection.

Swap the profile branch to call checkDolbyInstanceControl() instead,
matching the existing working pattern.

Signed-off-by: raghavt20 <raghavt20@aospa.co>
---
 smali/com/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali/com/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider.smali b/smali/com/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider.smali
index 0000000..0000000 100644
--- a/smali/com/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider.smali
+++ b/smali/com/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider.smali
@@ -3578,7 +3578,7 @@
     invoke-static {p2, p3}, Landroid/util/Log;->d(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)I

     .line 573
-    invoke-direct {p0}, Lcom/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider;->checkDolbyInstance()V
+    invoke-direct {p0}, Lcom/dolby/daxservice/dolbyprovider/DolbyProvider;->checkDolbyInstanceControl()V

     .line 574
     invoke-static {p1}, Ljava/lang/Integer;->parseInt(Ljava/lang/String;)I
